WEBVTT

00:00.770 --> 00:05.230
I am Mia Luna Tearmoon, 
Imperial Princess of the Tearmoon Empire.

00:05.610 --> 00:09.940
I was drawn to your brother, 
so I must not be a decent woman.

00:10.650 --> 00:13.400
That is the situation, Prince Sion.

00:13.940 --> 00:16.810
I truly regret that
 I must disappoint you,

00:16.810 --> 00:21.160
but I am not in a position to 
accept your invitation.

00:22.700 --> 00:25.290
I see. I am disappointed, but I understand.

00:26.270 --> 00:29.720
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:33.000 --> 00:38.100
<i>How delicious! I rejected Prince Sion's 
invitation in a public setting!</i>

00:38.770 --> 00:39.930
Princess Mia!

00:41.360 --> 00:43.430
I appreciate your help earlier.

00:43.430 --> 00:47.400
Still, though perhaps not terribly so,
 I am an unsuitable match for you.

00:47.680 --> 00:50.040
You should go to the ball with Prince Sion.

00:50.040 --> 00:51.040
If you feel that way,

00:52.230 --> 00:54.780
then improve yourself for me.

00:55.390 --> 00:57.410
So that you <i>are</i> a suitable match.

00:58.400 --> 01:01.870
B-But, I have no skill.

01:02.250 --> 01:07.080
No matter how hard I work, I'll never 
rival Prince Sion, or even my brother.

01:08.560 --> 01:14.880
Prince Abel, all you know is that you are 
no match for them <i>right now</i>. Is that not so?

01:16.350 --> 01:18.780
If you don't measure up today, 
then perhaps tomorrow.

01:18.780 --> 01:21.270
If not tomorrow, then the next day.

01:21.270 --> 01:26.230
None of us can know the heights to 
which our efforts might take us.

01:26.590 --> 01:32.820
It is absolutely possible for you to beat
Prince Sion and your brother.

01:33.170 --> 01:36.310
I chose you as my partner for the dance.

01:36.310 --> 01:39.530
I, Mia Luna Tearmoon, guarantee it.

01:41.030 --> 01:42.410
Princess Mia...

01:43.410 --> 01:46.790
<i>It is plain that some people 
are divinely chosen.</i>

01:47.370 --> 01:51.550
<i>It's ridiculous for an inferior, 
unchosen person like me to try.</i>

01:53.090 --> 01:55.340
<i>That was my mindset.</i>

01:55.810 --> 01:58.280
<i>I never dreamed anyone 
would say that about me.</i>

01:58.280 --> 02:04.480
<i>Thus, because of Mia, Abel was no longer
doomed to a future as an inferior prince.</i>

02:04.480 --> 02:05.950
<i>But Mia...</i>

02:05.950 --> 02:08.820
<i>I need to have Prince Abel work hard.</i>

02:08.820 --> 02:11.410
<i>After all, when the time comes,</i>

02:11.410 --> 02:16.130
<i>I can't have him get stopped from sending 
reinforcements by his nasty brother.</i>

02:16.130 --> 02:19.990
<i>...would remain unbending 
in her Mia-first philosophy.</i>

03:50.330 --> 03:54.960
<b>Episode 4: Shall We Dance?</b>

03:59.680 --> 04:02.450
Prince Sion, you look very dashing!

04:02.450 --> 04:04.130
I wouldn't go that far.

04:05.750 --> 04:08.920
<i>Is Princess Mia still not here?</i>

04:12.000 --> 04:13.390
Why?

04:13.770 --> 04:16.130
How could this happen?

04:18.770 --> 04:23.400
<i>In high spirits with her makeup 
and dress perfectly on-point,</i>

04:23.400 --> 04:26.480
<i>Mia was confidently
walking the academy grounds...</i>

04:26.480 --> 04:29.600
<i>Favorite perfume, check. 
Everything is perfect!</i>

04:30.740 --> 04:32.450
<i>When...</i>

04:32.770 --> 04:35.820
My, aren't you a lovely horse!

04:42.400 --> 04:47.900
<i>The excessively applied
perfume brought on the sneeze.</i>

04:48.600 --> 04:51.100
There's nothing we can 
do at this point, Anne.

04:51.420 --> 04:54.560
Just do my makeup enough 
to avoid embarrassment.

04:54.880 --> 04:58.320
And grab any dress from the ones over there.

04:58.320 --> 04:59.240
No.

05:00.460 --> 05:03.490
I will not allow you to 
lose face, Princess Mia.

05:03.840 --> 05:05.750
Leave everything to me!

05:17.350 --> 05:18.980
Hey. Look there!

05:22.410 --> 05:24.070
U-Unbelievable...

05:26.200 --> 05:28.660
Princess Mia of the Tearmoon Empire!

05:30.590 --> 05:34.930
<i>I knew it. Of course I stick out 
at the party dressed so simply.</i>

05:35.260 --> 05:36.050
<i>No!</i>

05:36.900 --> 05:39.170
<i>Unconstricted by a corset.</i>

05:39.170 --> 05:41.760
<i>A lovely complexion from 
being freshly bathed.</i>

05:41.760 --> 05:46.530
<i>A pure white dress that 
accentuates her beautiful skin.</i>

05:46.530 --> 05:50.750
<i>All of this illuminated in the 
gentle glow of the ballroom...</i>

05:50.750 --> 05:53.240
<i>She looks just like a goddess of the moon!</i>

05:53.240 --> 05:57.960
<i>Mia had captivated the boys in the 
ballroom in the blink of an eye.</i>

05:58.870 --> 06:00.670
<i>She's so beautiful.</i>

06:01.170 --> 06:03.130
<i>I'm going to dance with </i>her?<i></i>

06:03.650 --> 06:04.990
<i>For real?</i>

06:04.990 --> 06:06.840
<i>I must be dreaming...</i>

06:07.940 --> 06:09.300
Prince Abel...

06:10.320 --> 06:12.010
I am so sorry.

06:13.540 --> 06:16.890
<i>She's selecting a different 
partner after all.</i>

06:17.790 --> 06:20.000
I'm not upset.

06:20.960 --> 06:23.000
You look very beautiful.

06:23.450 --> 06:27.040
Oh, thank you, Prince Abel!

06:27.690 --> 06:28.280
Huh?

06:28.510 --> 06:31.740
<i>I'm so relieved he didn't 
say anything about my dress!</i>

06:32.160 --> 06:33.910
Now then, shall we dance?

06:35.010 --> 06:35.910
What?

06:37.280 --> 06:45.090
<i>Mia had just one special skill at 
which she excelled above others:</i>

06:45.680 --> 06:47.650
<i>social dance.</i>

06:50.400 --> 06:54.640
So what? She made a big splash, 
but her dancing is nothing special.

06:54.640 --> 06:57.610
She may be the princess of a 
powerful nation, but she's still a child.

06:57.610 --> 06:59.230
I suppose this is all we can expect.

07:01.200 --> 07:02.320
<i>You're wrong.</i>

07:02.940 --> 07:07.650
<i>Her steps are neatly leading me by example.</i>

07:08.320 --> 07:11.860
<i>Princess Mia is bringing 
herself down to my level.</i>

07:15.020 --> 07:17.220
That's it, Prince Abel.

07:17.220 --> 07:19.750
You're doing quite well!

07:21.230 --> 07:26.260
<i>She believes in me. I won't force her 
to lose face on my account.</i>

07:32.520 --> 07:38.100
Anne, while I'm at the party,
 use this money however you'd like.

07:40.590 --> 07:44.520
Listen up. This isn't pocket 
money for us to use as we like.

07:44.520 --> 07:46.270
What? It's not?

07:46.270 --> 07:49.700
You're saying Princess Mia has
allowed us to use our own judgment.

07:49.700 --> 07:51.440
Which means...

07:51.440 --> 07:52.700
Exactly!

07:52.700 --> 07:56.700
Princess Mia has ordered us to 
accomplish something with this money!

07:57.390 --> 08:01.410
<i>Princess Mia, I've heard your 
intentions loud and clear!</i>

08:01.410 --> 08:03.970
<i>I swear I will meet your expectations!</i>

08:06.810 --> 08:09.610
You're... Lady Tiona's...

08:09.610 --> 08:14.430
Please! Help! Lady Tiona... kidnapped!

08:23.470 --> 08:24.980
Prince Abel?

08:25.330 --> 08:26.550
Where are we going?

08:28.690 --> 08:29.930
Prince Sion.

08:30.750 --> 08:31.900
Is something wrong?

08:32.450 --> 08:34.980
May I ask you to dance with Her Highness?

08:34.980 --> 08:38.120
<i>What?! What do you think you're doing?!</i>

08:39.670 --> 08:44.330
I was actually considering asking 
Princess Mia to join me for a dance.

08:44.330 --> 08:46.450
Would that be all right?

08:47.390 --> 08:49.350
I will go obtain some refreshments.

08:49.350 --> 08:50.550
<i>Why?!</i>

08:52.030 --> 08:56.160
Oh, o-of course. Just one dance.

08:58.020 --> 09:00.220
<i>I used to think my lack of ability</i>

09:00.660 --> 09:04.450
<i>meant I could never be as good as Sion, 
no matter how hard I tried.</i>

09:04.930 --> 09:05.690
<i>But...</i>

09:06.560 --> 09:08.680
<i>Next time, I won't concede.</i>

09:09.870 --> 09:13.210
Kidnapped? By whom?

09:13.210 --> 09:15.030
I do... not know.

09:15.880 --> 09:18.370
Lady Tiona still there.

09:19.020 --> 09:21.870
Only I escape.

09:22.420 --> 09:25.080
Help. Please!

09:25.870 --> 09:28.230
<i>What would Mia do if she were here?</i>

09:30.250 --> 09:32.920
Very well. I'll help you.

09:46.390 --> 09:47.560
Guards?

09:48.910 --> 09:51.280
What next? What do we do?

09:52.000 --> 09:53.410
Ladies.

09:54.490 --> 09:58.630
You're Prince Sion's... 
Mr. Keithwood, right?

09:58.630 --> 10:00.620
I'm flattered you remember.

10:00.960 --> 10:03.080
Is something troubling you?

10:03.680 --> 10:04.820
What's going on?

10:04.820 --> 10:07.790
Prince Sion and Princess Mia 
are going to dance.

10:13.210 --> 10:16.970
<i>To be honest, I'm loathe to dance with Sion.</i>

10:17.320 --> 10:19.320
<i>But this is a golden opportunity.</i>

10:19.320 --> 10:21.810
<i>I'll make him tumble brilliantly!</i>

10:21.810 --> 10:25.930
<i>Let's see how you like being 
humiliated in front of everyone!</i>

10:27.000 --> 10:31.460
<i>I see. I followed them because 
I thought I smelled something fishy.</i>

10:32.590 --> 10:37.310
His Highness Prince Sion would be 
angry if I abandoned ladies in trouble.

10:37.880 --> 10:39.960
Allow me to assist.

10:39.960 --> 10:41.370
Really? You help?

10:41.780 --> 10:43.580
But what are you going to do?

10:43.830 --> 10:46.290
It's simple, really.

11:11.880 --> 11:16.320
<i>I expected a graceful princess, 
but she's surprisingly wild and untamed.</i>

11:20.250 --> 11:24.240
<i>I-I didn't plan for him to 
be this good at dancing!</i>

11:24.510 --> 11:28.460
So what? This is only because
Prince Sion is such a good dancer.

11:28.460 --> 11:34.000
You both must know that a dance doesn't 
work if only one of the pair is good.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.460
Princess Rafina!

11:50.710 --> 11:53.640
<i>A brilliant dance that 
captivates those watching</i>

11:53.640 --> 11:57.590
<i>is only possible when
 both partners are skilled.</i>

12:23.840 --> 12:25.930
Lady Tiona! All right?

12:27.730 --> 12:30.660
Liora?! You're safe?

12:32.730 --> 12:35.700
I am so glad you're unharmed, Lady Rudolvon.

12:36.560 --> 12:38.980
You're... Princess Mia's maid...

12:41.980 --> 12:44.950
When I returned to my room, 
my dress was gone.

12:45.200 --> 12:50.410
There was a note saying, "If you want 
your dress, come to the north tower."

12:50.780 --> 12:53.420
How awful! Who would do such a thing?

12:53.980 --> 12:56.790
An acquaintance of yours or 
Princess Mia's, I presume.

12:57.190 --> 12:58.170
What?

12:58.830 --> 13:01.840
I found this on the guards outside.

13:02.220 --> 13:05.300
The crest of the Tearmoon Empire? 
You don't mean...

13:05.670 --> 13:09.010
They were probably in the 
employ of imperial nobles.

13:09.680 --> 13:11.720
That's... possible.

13:12.250 --> 13:16.940
I was told not to attend the ball because 
I'd be a disgrace to the empire's nobility.

13:17.770 --> 13:19.150
That's awful.

13:19.890 --> 13:24.190
I don't have the means to acquire 
a large number of dresses.

13:24.920 --> 13:30.410
So, Liora, you didn't need to 
push yourself so hard or panic.

13:30.930 --> 13:32.430
Lady Tiona...

13:35.530 --> 13:38.710
<i>If I were in her position...</i>

13:42.280 --> 13:46.170
Liora, go to the shop 
in town and buy a dress.

13:46.170 --> 13:48.070
This money should be enough.

13:48.070 --> 13:49.390
Where... come from?

13:49.700 --> 13:53.350
It's money Princess Mia 
entrusted to me. Go! Quickly!

13:57.520 --> 14:00.310
Lady Tiona, in the meantime, 
let's do your makeup.

14:00.570 --> 14:04.780
Are you sure that you, 
as Princess Mia's maid, should assist her?

14:05.440 --> 14:07.620
What do you mean by that?

14:07.620 --> 14:11.200
Her Highness Princess Mia reigns at 
the top of the empire's nobility.

14:11.810 --> 14:15.370
If the nobles who confined 
Lady Rudolvon were from the empire,

14:15.600 --> 14:19.520
there is a possibility that 
Princess Mia wished it, is there not?

14:21.710 --> 14:24.090
You think Princess Mia did this?

14:28.010 --> 14:30.510
Don't be ridiculous!

14:30.950 --> 14:35.970
Um, Mr. Keithwood, I also do not believe
 Her Highness Princess Mia would do this.

14:37.640 --> 14:38.810
I see.

14:39.120 --> 14:42.360
Well, if the victim herself says so.

14:49.080 --> 14:53.120
Princess Mia, if possible, 
I'd like to do a slow song next.

14:53.600 --> 14:58.580
I do believe there is a partner more 
suited for you here, Prince Sion.

15:01.550 --> 15:06.500
<i>I can't accomplish what I want with you, 
so I'm leaving things here for today!</i>

15:09.410 --> 15:10.480
I made it!

15:11.650 --> 15:12.400
That's...

15:16.080 --> 15:17.310
E-Excuse me!

15:17.310 --> 15:18.400
Prince Sion!

15:18.400 --> 15:19.520
You're...

15:19.940 --> 15:22.070
My name is Tiona Rudolvon.

15:22.070 --> 15:25.480
Your Highness, Mr. Keithwood 
asked me to give you this.

15:29.690 --> 15:31.400
A kidnapping incident?!

15:31.940 --> 15:33.920
<i>Mentioned in an abundance of caution.</i>

15:33.920 --> 15:37.090
<i>Possibility of Princess Mia's involvement.</i>

15:38.590 --> 15:40.620
<i>That can't possibly be the case.</i>

15:41.120 --> 15:43.860
Thanks so much! Thanks so much!

15:41.120 --> 15:45.590
<i>He doesn't seem to actually suspect 
she's involved either.</i>

15:43.860 --> 15:45.590
It's fine, really.

15:46.600 --> 15:48.050
<i>At any rate...</i>

15:50.030 --> 15:54.800
<i>Most likely, Princess Mia spotted 
Lady Rudolvon during our dance,</i>

15:55.120 --> 15:58.770
<i>sized up the situation in one glance,</i>

15:59.230 --> 16:04.250
<i>and entrusted her to me to ensure
 Lady Rudolvon could at least enjoy the ball.</i>

16:05.900 --> 16:07.680
<i>More suited for me...</i>

16:07.680 --> 16:12.980
<i>In other words, you meant there 
was someone who needed me.</i>

16:12.980 --> 16:14.950
<i>Wrong in every way.</i>

16:15.700 --> 16:17.730
Prince Sion?

16:17.730 --> 16:19.660
Oh, pardon me.

16:20.220 --> 16:24.370
Lady Rudolvon, might I have the 
pleasure of a dance with you?

16:27.760 --> 16:28.470
Yes.

16:30.080 --> 16:31.420
Prince Abel!

16:33.090 --> 16:36.530
Hey, Princess Mia. 
Your dancing was wonderful.

16:36.530 --> 16:37.470
My!

16:38.560 --> 16:40.430
Why, thank you.

16:42.760 --> 16:45.150
I really can't compare.

16:45.380 --> 16:46.910
Can't compare to what?

16:46.910 --> 16:48.740
To Prince Sion.

16:48.740 --> 16:53.870
Unfortunately, I don't have the skill 
to highlight your talent like that.

16:56.400 --> 16:58.830
It's cold and very good.

16:59.390 --> 17:04.050
You saw how intense our dance was,
 so you acquired a new drink, right?

17:04.050 --> 17:04.790
Huh?

17:05.820 --> 17:09.250
Prince Abel, please don't put yourself down.

17:10.510 --> 17:14.210
<i>This is the first time
 I've had a gentleman my age</i>

17:14.210 --> 17:18.680
<i>treat me kindly as a girl 
and not as a princess.</i>

17:19.680 --> 17:22.270
You are a wonderful individual.

17:25.300 --> 17:29.440
Still, if possible, I'd like to 
equal Sion in dance ability...

17:30.460 --> 17:33.900
In that case, I shall give you lessons.

17:34.320 --> 17:38.360
I am a strict teacher, so you ought 
to prepare yourself for that.

17:41.180 --> 17:42.330
<i>Thus it was that,</i>

17:42.330 --> 17:47.990
<i>for the first time in her life, Mia was able to 
experience heart-pounding delight at a ball.</i>

17:49.770 --> 17:50.760
<i>But...</i>

17:50.760 --> 17:52.460
A kidnapping incident?!

17:52.820 --> 17:55.670
Yes. You see it went like this,
 and like that...

17:56.050 --> 18:01.000
and I humbly acted as your proxy.

18:01.000 --> 18:03.860
<i>Th-Th-Th-This is terrible!</i>

18:03.860 --> 18:08.330
<i>If I don't take clear action on this, 
I'm likely to earn Princess Rafina's ire!</i>

18:08.330 --> 18:11.740
<i>I'm sure Sion and Tiona won't have
a positive impression of me, either!</i>

18:11.740 --> 18:12.650
<i>If that happens...</i>

18:13.110 --> 18:15.580
Welcome to the guillotine route!

18:17.310 --> 18:19.560
<i>I absolutely have to do something!</i>

18:20.450 --> 18:23.600
Why do our attendants have 
to be forcibly sent away?

18:23.600 --> 18:27.500
All that happened was that a mere 
country noble's daughter was confined!

18:28.350 --> 18:31.500
<i>The pedigreed central aristocracy 
can of course commit affronts</i>

18:31.760 --> 18:35.960
<i>to commoners, but also 
provincial nobles with impunity.</i>

18:36.480 --> 18:39.180
<i>That system of values is 
deeply entrenched in the empire.</i>

18:39.750 --> 18:45.680
<i>These people probably have no idea 
how much hatred that incurs them.</i>

18:46.710 --> 18:50.900
You certainly might have a valid point.

18:52.420 --> 18:56.130
That is, if this had been 
done inside the empire.

18:56.130 --> 18:56.860
Huh?

18:57.150 --> 19:00.950
Do you realize who governs this academy?

19:02.670 --> 19:04.570
<i>Mia considered the situation.</i>

19:04.570 --> 19:10.340
<i>If she judged her fellow imperials 
according to her own sense of values,</i>

19:10.340 --> 19:12.490
<i>their discontent would be directed at her.</i>

19:12.490 --> 19:14.200
<i>In order to avoid that...</i>

19:14.200 --> 19:15.130
Indeed!

19:16.010 --> 19:18.480
Princess Rafina is a high-minded individual.

19:18.480 --> 19:21.160
Do you think she would 
overlook an outrage like this

19:21.160 --> 19:24.720
against one of the 
academy's precious students?

19:25.380 --> 19:29.350
<i>Let them blame Princess Rafina! 
This is the answer!</i>

19:29.940 --> 19:35.210
This sort of offense would normally require 
<i>your</i> dismissal from the academy as well.

19:35.910 --> 19:37.070
But...

19:37.380 --> 19:40.530
However, that outcome does indeed seem harsh.

19:41.100 --> 19:47.240
I am planning to intervene with
Princess Rafina regarding this incident.

19:48.220 --> 19:49.700
Princess Mia...

19:50.760 --> 19:55.420
Repatriation for the four
attendants directly involved.

19:55.720 --> 20:01.380
Probation for the students because of 
unclear levels of involvement. Is that it?

20:01.700 --> 20:03.260
Y-Yes.

20:03.810 --> 20:07.680
Do you not find that to be 
a rather light punishment?

20:08.390 --> 20:09.680
Princess Mia.

20:12.090 --> 20:15.100
<i>Oh, no! Wh-Wh-What do I do?</i>

20:15.480 --> 20:17.260
<i>What now?</i>

20:23.830 --> 20:26.610
You only realize how rotten it is

20:26.610 --> 20:31.530
to refuse to eat Yellow Moon tomatoes 
once you have no food.

20:32.640 --> 20:33.300
What?

20:33.920 --> 20:38.780
<i>I can't afford to be escaping reality!
 This is no time for that!</i>

20:38.780 --> 20:39.540
Princess Mia.

20:39.540 --> 20:40.630
Yes?!

20:41.120 --> 20:46.320
You mean, one does bad things because 
one does not know that they are bad.

20:46.320 --> 20:47.600
Is that it?

20:49.100 --> 20:50.060
Huh?

20:50.330 --> 20:52.930
There are two aspects to punishment.

20:52.930 --> 20:55.680
One aspect is to offer 
consolation to the victim.

20:55.680 --> 20:58.830
The other is to make the
 offender reflect on their actions.

20:58.830 --> 21:04.430
In this case, the harm was heavily mitigated 
by the actions of your confidante Anne.

21:04.430 --> 21:07.530
This makes showing consideration 
to the victim easier.

21:09.260 --> 21:14.080
A merciful punishment that gives the 
offenders opportunity to reflect and grow.

21:14.390 --> 21:19.280
Princess Mia, you have chosen an approach 
more suited to this place of learning.

21:21.810 --> 21:24.400
Yes. That is it exactly.

21:24.400 --> 21:28.010
<i>Mia did not fully understand, 
but she jumped on the opportunity.</i>

21:28.290 --> 21:32.240
I see why they call you the 
Wisdom of the Empire. I'm impressed.

21:35.230 --> 21:37.760
So, um... Mia...

21:38.210 --> 21:39.400
Y-Yes?

21:40.070 --> 21:40.870
Would you...

21:41.750 --> 21:43.790
<i>There's still something else?</i>

21:45.540 --> 21:49.030
Would you be friends with me?

21:50.290 --> 21:51.030
What?

21:54.280 --> 21:59.000
<i>Thus it was that Mia became 
friends with Princess Rafina,</i>

21:59.000 --> 22:04.960
<i>who, in the prior timeline, 
consistently looked coldly on her.</i>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.980
Illustration by bb Kuroda
